    "conclusion": "The independently selected and frozen RR-9 retinal flight signature did not replicate as a stable cross-mission gravity signature. Artificial gravity attenuation in OSD-758 is not enriched in the RR-9 panel relative to the transcriptome background. A time-specific seven-day radiation concordance was enriched beyond random gene panels, but it did not persist at one or four months and remains a prospective hypothesis rather than causal attribution."
